<title>JAPAN: Yokogawa Bridge plans share split.</title>
<headline>Yokogawa Bridge plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yokogawa Bridge Corp said on Tuesday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
